    "message": "Refer to the fork origin's chunks in a new child's first save\n\nA new branch had no earlier save to take chunk locations from, so its first\nsave checked and packed every chunk again. It now takes the locations of the\nCheckpoint its fork_origin names and packs only the chunks that differ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
